@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Overview of Cloud Computing";
    ViewData["ActiveMenu"] = "AzureDevOps";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <p class="text-center lead">Cloud computing revolutionizes the way businesses operate by providing scalable, on-demand computing resources over the internet.</p>
    <hr />

    <!-- Introduction to Cloud Computing -->
    <div class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="text-primary">What is Cloud Computing?</h2>
        <p>
            Cloud computing is the delivery of computing services—including servers, storage, databases, networking, software, and analytics—over the internet, offering flexibility, innovation, and cost savings.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/cloud-computing-intro.jpg" alt="Cloud Computing Overview" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Cloud computing enables global access to computing resources.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Benefits of Cloud Computing -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-success">Key Benefits of Cloud Computing</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Cost Savings:</strong> Pay only for what you use, eliminating the need for costly hardware investments.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Scalability:</strong> Instantly scale resources up or down to meet changing demands.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Reliability:</strong> Cloud providers offer high availability and robust disaster recovery options.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Security:</strong> Advanced security measures like encryption and access controls protect data.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Automatic Updates:</strong> Cloud platforms automatically update software and security patches.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/cloud-benefits.jpg" alt="Cloud Benefits" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Cloud computing provides businesses with enhanced agility and efficiency.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Types of Cloud Computing -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-warning">Types of Cloud Computing</h2>
        <p>
            Cloud computing is categorized into different service models and deployment models based on functionality and accessibility.
        </p>
        <h4>Service Models:</h4>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>IaaS (Infrastructure as a Service):</strong> Provides virtualized computing resources like servers and storage.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>PaaS (Platform as a Service):</strong> Offers a development environment with tools and frameworks.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>SaaS (Software as a Service):</strong> Delivers software applications over the internet.</li>
        </ul>
        <h4 class="mt-3">Deployment Models:</h4>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Public Cloud:</strong> Services are hosted by third-party providers and shared across multiple organizations.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Private Cloud:</strong> Dedicated infrastructure for a single organization, ensuring higher control and security.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Hybrid Cloud:</strong> A combination of public and private clouds for optimized flexibility.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/cloud-types.jpg" alt="Types of Cloud Computing" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Cloud computing models cater to diverse business needs.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Cloud Security Considerations -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-danger">Cloud Security Considerations</h2>
        <p>
            Security is a crucial aspect of cloud computing, ensuring data integrity, confidentiality, and availability.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Data Encryption:</strong> Encrypting data both in transit and at rest enhances security.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Access Control:</strong> Implementing role-based access control (RBAC) prevents unauthorized access.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Compliance:</strong> Cloud providers must adhere to regulatory standards like GDPR, HIPAA, and ISO 27001.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Disaster Recovery:</strong> Cloud solutions offer automated backup and recovery plans.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/cloud-security.jpg" alt="Cloud Security" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Security measures safeguard cloud environments against threats.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-info">Conclusion</h2>
        <p>
            Cloud computing is a game-changer in the digital era, providing businesses with scalable, cost-effective, and secure solutions. Organizations leveraging the cloud can enhance productivity, improve agility, and foster innovation.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/cloud-future.jpg" alt="Future of Cloud Computing" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Cloud computing continues to evolve, shaping the future of technology.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>